```console
$ scherzo-cloud run --help
Work with Scherzo Cloud runs

Usage: scherzo-cloud run [COMMAND]

Commands:
  cancel     Request cancellation of a Scherzo Cloud run
  create     Create a Scherzo Cloud run
  input      View, download, or delete retained run inputs
  input-set  Administer single-use Run Input Sets
  show       Show a Scherzo Cloud run
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
